{"unit_id":"FeatherHunter__dsh-prompt#readme-8","repo":"FeatherHunter/dsh-prompt","commit":"64b35b8300786882b5cbc9dc6b6cc532037caba8","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt README · 或者：dsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-prompt@0.4.41 --registry https://registry.npmjs.org\n```\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n安装完成后重启一次DSH。\n\n**👇 装完重启，输入框左侧多出这枚按钮就是成功。**\n\n<img src=\"assets/readme/01-install-ready.png\" width=\"720\" alt=\"安装成功后输入框左侧的 Prompt 按钮\" style=\"border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:6px\">\n\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">","source":"extracted","section":"或者"}
{"unit_id":"FeatherHunter__dsh-prompt#readme-9","repo":"FeatherHunter/dsh-prompt","commit":"64b35b8300786882b5cbc9dc6b6cc532037caba8","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt README · 入口一<br>Prompt 按钮：</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n鼠标移到输入框左侧的「Prompt」按钮，列表自动展开——官方预置模板和我们自定义的模板都能看到。\n\n**👇 按钮一点，面板长这样。**\n\n<img src=\"assets/readme/02-panel-button.png\" width=\"640\" alt=\"Prompt 按钮悬浮面板：范围与标签筛选、模板列表、底栏一键屏蔽预制模板\" style=\"border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:6px\">\n\n点底栏「屏蔽预制模板」，屏蔽官方预置Prompt；再点「展示预制模板」解除屏蔽。\n\n不想鼠标划过就展开？点底栏「当前：悬浮触发」（或设置面板里的「触发方式」行右侧按钮），此后只有点击按钮才开合，鼠标偶然划过不再闪烁；按钮变成「当前：点击触发」即是已切过去，再点切回。\n\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">","source":"extracted","section":"入口一<br>Prompt 按钮"}
{"unit_id":"FeatherHunter__dsh-prompt#readme-10","repo":"FeatherHunter/dsh-prompt","commit":"64b35b8300786882b5cbc9dc6b6cc532037caba8","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt README · 入口二<br>/prompt 触发源：</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n只敲一个 `/` 不再列出模板，命令菜单保持干净；敲 `/prompt` 或者 `/p` 才看到全部模板。<br>\n`/prompt` 后面继续输入可以缩小范围（如 `/prompt复盘`；不要加空格，宿主遇到空格会关掉菜单）。\n\n**👇 /prompt 看到全部模板。**\n\n<img src=\"assets/readme/03-trigger-prompt.png\" width=\"640\" alt=\"`/prompt` 触发源：模板名 + 标签 + 正文开头的候选列表\" style=\"border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:6px\">\n\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">","source":"extracted","section":"入口二<br>/prompt 触发源"}
{"unit_id":"FeatherHunter__dsh-prompt#readme-11","repo":"FeatherHunter/dsh-prompt","commit":"64b35b8300786882b5cbc9dc6b6cc532037caba8","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt README · 设置面板<br>SETTINGS：</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n**👇 设置面板提供各种功能。**\n\n<img src=\"assets/readme/05-templates-gallery.png\" width=\"640\" alt=\"模板一览：设置页中的 24 条预制模板\" style=\"border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:6px\">\n\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">","source":"extracted","section":"设置面板<br>SETTINGS"}
{"unit_id":"FeatherHunter__dsh-prompt#readme-12","repo":"FeatherHunter/dsh-prompt","commit":"64b35b8300786882b5cbc9dc6b6cc532037caba8","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt README · 自定义与管理<br>CUSTOM：</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n**👇 新增自定义Prompt提示词模板：名称、标签、文字颜色、正文 全部可以DIY。**\n\n<img src=\"assets/readme/06-custom-manage.png\" width=\"560\" alt=\"自定义管理：新增自定义模板弹窗（名称、标签、文字颜色、正文）\" style=\"border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:6px\">\n\n正文会按你写的原样保留：换行都在，包括开头和结尾的空行（只忽略首尾的空格与制表符）。想让插入后的光标停在指定位置，就在正文里放 `{{cursor}}`——只认第一个，其余会被删掉。不带标记时，光标落在插入文本之后；`/prompt` 斜杠插入只去掉标记、不移动光标。插入后按一次撤销，可能先撤销「落光标」那一步（会看到标记文本回来），再按一次才撤销插入。另外，字面 `{{cursor}}` 这串字符本身暂时无法表达——把它写进正文，它就会被当作光标标记。\n\n**👇 文字颜色可以修改，支持文字描边。**","source":"extracted","section":"自定义与管理<br>CUSTOM"}
{"unit_id":"FeatherHunter__dsh-prompt#readme-13","repo":"FeatherHunter/dsh-prompt","commit":"64b35b8300786882b5cbc9dc6b6cc532037caba8","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt README · 自定义与管理<br>CUSTOM：<img src=\"assets/readme/07-custom-manage-color.png\" width=\"560\" alt=\"文字颜色浮层：60 色可选、默认跟随主题、文字描边开关\" style=\"border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:6px\">\n\n**👇 自定义提示词：可配置文字颜色。**\n\n<img src=\"assets/readme/02-panel-button-only-custom.png\" width=\"640\" alt=\"Prompt 按钮悬浮面板：预制模板已收起，只显示自定义模板\" style=\"border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:6px\">\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- MORE-START -->\n<div align=\"center\">","source":"extracted","section":"自定义与管理<br>CUSTOM"}
